    {
      "text": "Lord visited Sarah as he had said, Gen. 21:1. visiting the iniquity of the fathers upon the children, Ex. 20:5 (34:7; Num. 14:18; Deut. 5:9; Mosiah 13:13). Lord visited Hannah, so that she conceived, 1 Sam. 2:21. What is … the son of man, that thou visitest him, Ps. 8:4 (Heb. 2:6). God of Israel, awake to visit all the heathen, Ps. 59:5. Shall I not visit for these things, Jer. 5:9 (5:29; 9:9). I will visit upon you the evil of your doings, Jer. 23:2. after seventy years be accomplished at Babylon I will visit you, Jer. 29:10. After many days thou shalt be visited, Ezek. 38:8. I will visit upon her the days of Baalim, Hosea 2:13. I shall visit the transgressions of Israel upon him, Amos 3:14.",
